      "writtenOn": "2022-05-26T20:26:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my testing with rapid toggling from UI, there is an edge case where HciDevicePresence becomes false and process state is at TurningOn, and when this case is hit, the state machine is stuck at TurningOn.\n\nMaybe quick and dirty local fix is `action_on_hci_presence_changed` should return ProcessState::Off when `present` is false and prev_state is TurningOn, and additionally context.state_machine.action_on_bluetooth_stopped needs to be invoked.\n\nAfter that prototype fix, I don\u0027t see any other issue with rapid toggling.",
      "revId": "957f88c9eb058c8b941b6224e57753bc757fdef5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
