      "writtenOn": "2022-05-26T23:57:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I opted to add this in timeout instead. So if a timeout occurs while it\u0027s in TurningOn (and !present), it will switch to Off instead. The next present \u003d True will turn it back on.",
